SetIssuerAllowance_Captable_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the Safe
│   └── it should revert with OnlyBoard
├── when the module is not Options or Rounds or Vesting
│   └── it should revert with OnlyModule
├── when the class does not exist
│   └── it should revert with UnknownClass
└── when the Safe sets an allowance for a known module
    ├── it should replace the allowance
    └── it should emit IssuerAllowanceSet
